00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.990
Eliminate... Eliminate... Eliminate...

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:25.220
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.990
Metalgreymon!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.550
Who's that?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.180
Rebellimon...

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.680
Rebellimon.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:49.510
Rebellimon.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.730
Rebellimon, who failed to die.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.310
The reckless Rebellimon.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.500
REBELLIMON

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.440
Rebellimon...

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.900
So that's not your friend?!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:01.710
THE VAGRANT WAR DEMON, REBELLIMON

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.630
A new face...

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.300
Where'd you come from?

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.520
Rebellimon, no!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.440
Watch out!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:34.540
We're just passing by!
There's no reason for us to fight!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.460
Why you... Stop!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.380
I don't need a reason.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.630
Metalgreymon!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.530
Rebellimon!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:21.790
Hey!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.710
Don't make me repeat it.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.920
Stay away from me.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.980
Looks like Rebellimon has issues.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.480
You, what's your name?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.400
Cutemon...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.950
"I have to keep fighting to live"?

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.330
Yeah...

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.040
That's what Rebellimon said.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:06.090
That's why Rebellimon came to this
place where outlaws are everywhere.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.890
CUTEMON

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.500
<i>Outlaws?</i>

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.510
<i>There was nothing
in these wastelands before...</i>

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.470
<i>but it became like this
before I knew it.</i>

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.370
BOARMON

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.020
<i>Digimon started to gather here.</i>

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:28.690
It's more comfortable than a cave,
so that's why I moved here too, but...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.150
Soon...

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:35.070
<i>many scary Digimon came over too.</i>

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:39.080
<i>And they would bully the weak
and start turf wars.</i>

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:41.890
TEKKAMON

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.000
<i>That was when...</i>

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:54.170
Answer me. Are you all strong?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.850
<i>I thought that Rebellimon had saved me.</i>

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.260
<i>But...</i>

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.690
Um, thank y--

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.360
Get lost.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.860
The weak...

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.070
are a nuisance.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:28.580
<i>It seems like Rebellimon
doesn't remember the past at all.</i>

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.340
<i>Not even the reasons for fighting or</i>

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.840
<i>the reasons for wanting to win.</i>

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.700
BOLTMON

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:46.600
<i>Rebellimon keeps challenging
powerful Digimon to battle...</i>

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.960
<i>and continues fighting
even after getting battered.</i>

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.380
I'm worried that one day...

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.260
So you can't ignore Rebellimon.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.100
Hmm.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.220
Agumon?

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:29.230
It's been bothering me for a while too.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.190
You too? To be honest, same here.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:35.940
What is it?!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.260
Mega Flame!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.060
You okay?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.600
Yeah.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.330
Rebellimon!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.840
Greymon!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:49.520
Taichi!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:03.990
Taichi!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.320
Greymon!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.040
The big one's coming!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.380
Yeah.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.210
A little more...

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.300
Now!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.890
Mega Flame!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:11.430
Wow!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.810
It's healed!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.940
That's amazing!
You had a cool power like this?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:18.110
Thank you!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.610
Um, are you two always fighting like that?

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.110
It was amazing! And perfectly in sync!

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:31.450
Not just fighting.
Me and Taichi are always together!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.910
Aren't we, Taichi?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:43.510
Hey, Rebellimon. You say you don't know
the reason why you're fight--

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.130
I don't need one.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.800
Really?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:55.230
For example, what if it was
to protect something important?

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.480
Something important...

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.940
Yeah, like Agumon and my friends.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.820
