I can't describe it well though.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:13.370
When I think I gotta protect Taichi,
it gives me a ton of power!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.670
What is it?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.340
Everyone, run!

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.280
Boltmon...

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.370
Agumon!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.200
That Digimon's super strong!

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:57.540
Yeah.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.880
Stay out of this!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.730
Boltmon...

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.950
That's a Mega Digimon!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.780
Rebellimon!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.650
Rebellimon...

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:35.860
Answer me.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:40.200
Why did you...

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:45.120
Why did I save you?

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:48.420
Why did my body move?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:52.800
For example, what if it was
to protect something important?

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:58.760
When I think I gotta protect Taichi,
it gives me a ton of power!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:20.030
So, what are you gonna do from now?

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:23.910
I'm just going to find someone stronger...

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.330
