00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.290
Hey!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.580
If you wanna ride, hop on.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.550
What about you, Taichi and Agumon?

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:50.430
