00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.520
What about you two?

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.190
Straight ahead...

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:00.730
What?

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.000
You hear that?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.460
